OL,3,GNEWSAOverrunning roadworks shuts A14
OL,4,
OL,5,FPart of the A14 in Cambridgeshire is
OL,6,Fstill shut on Tuesday morning due to
OL,7,Foverrunning roadworks.
OL,9,FAn issue with the tarmac being laid
OL,10,Fmeans the westbound carriageway will be
OL,11,Fclosed between junction 22, Brampton
OL,12,FInterchange and junction 13, for
OL,13,FThrapston in Northamptonshire, "into
OL,14,Fthe morning peak travel period",
OL,15,FNational Highways said.
OL,17,FDiversions are in place that will take
OL,18,Fdrivers on the A1(M) towards
OL,19,FPeterborough before joining the A605
OL,20,Fwhere traffic can exit and re-join at
OL,21,Fjunction 13 of the A14.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
